lisa-design:
- release.prerelease: auto is required by compliance-framework/workflows release-go-plugin.yml; without it goreleaser would publish an -rcN tag as a full release.
- replace_existing_artifacts: true so a re-run of the release workflow on the same tag can overwrite assets instead of failing.
- archives.format migrated to formats: [tar.gz] only because goreleaser check flags it deprecated (check exits non-zero); archive output is unchanged.
